        <span itemprop="subject">the amount of heat measured by DSC</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">(the amount of heat generated at 100° C. to 250° C. in Table 3) was significantly smaller than that in the case where the specific surface area of a positive-electrode active material was 3.0 m 2 /g.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0119">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the amount of heat measured by DSC</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">(the amount of heat generated at 100° C. to 250° C. in Table 3) was slightly larger than that in the case where the specific surface area of a positive-electrode active material was 3.0 m 2 /g.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0119">
